SOLUTION 1 River
    pH 6.0 charge
    Cl 10
SOLUTION 2 Seawater
    pH 8.1 charge
    Cl 19000
MIX 1
    1 0.7
    2 0.3
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g) -0.678
USE mix 1
SAVE solution 1
END
USE solution 1
REACTION
    O2 1
    -1e-8
USE solution 1
USER_PUNCH
    -headings log_IAP_O2g
    -start
    10 PUNCH LOG10(MOLES("O2"))
    -end
END